    "reason": "Original $144C subtracts speed-derived WORD demand from app+$774; underflow at $1510 clears it and stores end reason1. $1EA8 maps reason1 to POWER DRAINAGE TOO GREAT, otherwise ICARUS DESTROYED; reset stores0 and shield depletion stores2. $33A16 follows shield WORD+$776 subtraction and queues original Shields Damaged directory entry64. Projectile gate $7256 tests/debits WORD+$794; unavailable type103 laser routes to original no Laser Energy entry67. The three alternate meter stages read those same reserve words. No fuel identity, percentage scale, saturation rewrite or arbitrary-state safety inferred. Bouncing-bomb producer $3692A sets BYTE+$AE1 and copies object WORD+$1A to WORD+$860. Paula consumes bounce then generic BYTE+$BB6 requests (generic wins if both); alternate handles bounce then branches over generic, deferring its pending flag. Both use sign-bit flags and retain distinct WORD arithmetic/scales; no assertion that sound outputs or priorities are equivalent. Generic request producers span contacts, hazards and detonation, so it is not labelled explosion-only. Static producer/consumer contract only; no new runtime or injected input.",
